Z||000014||Nashco||04-04-2001||01:57 AM||||I just got my car, and it needs a lot of work.  I'm just about to get the recall work done (some fools before me didn't) and start everything else after that.  To do:<P>Get recall work done<BR>Make exhaust channel hot air, not spread it all over and be loud<BR>Get Dog Bone (Make Urethane?)<BR>Rebuild suspension<BR>Lower with springs<BR>Get 17" wheels and tires<BR>Fix cracks in dash and repaint<BR>Get MP3 player and ditch stock stereo (anyone want it?)<BR>Fix warped console vinyl<BR>Detail everything<BR>Put second set of bushings in the functional headlight motor<BR>Find Synchros for Getrag and attempt a rebuild<P>Oh, and most important of all, find time for work outside of my hobbies <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
