Z||000021||fropuff||05-19-2001||11:10 PM||||Alright guys and girls, I've got an updated to-do list for this summer.  Here we go...<P>Things needed:<P>-Radio pod fascia<BR>-Right side front marker light<BR>-Dew wipes (doing them next weekend)<BR>-Right side drip rail<BR>-Headliner<BR>-Tinted GT sail panels<P>Things wanted:<P>-Center console w/ sub (from AusFiero)<BR>-Custom sub box for front compartment, ported into cabin; 2 subs<BR>-Pioneer DEH-P47DH 1.5 DIN CD player <BR>-Infinity Kappa/Reference 4"x6" plate speakers<BR>-Bass blockers for all 6 speakers<BR>-Wheels (16" front, 17" rear)<BR>-Leather seats (Mr. Mikes)<BR>-Power pulley kit (Fiero Store)<BR>-Performance auto shift kit (Fiero Store)<BR>-Cold air intake (Chris West)<P>Things to do:<P>-Tint windows (15%) (also next weekend when I do dew wipes)<BR>-Paint front fascia, ground effects, black  trim/moulding (black trim/moulding next weekend when I do the dew wipes)<BR>-Paint engine grilles w/ high temp. paint<BR>-Buff <BR>-Have steering wheel recovered<P>&gt;Not too much has changed, except that I'm going to do all the appearance stuff first, then the performance.  I'm going to go with a 3.4L pushrod w/ nitrous, but I'd probably get the NOS first.  I think it's reasonable to put up a budget of $2000.  Maybe a little more.  I do need a winter vehicle, so I can't go all out.<BR>||||reg||10
